WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet wide, toes turned out.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Soft bend in the knees, hands on hips or thighs.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hinge forward from the hips with a long spine.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Feel the hamstrings and inner thighs working.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise with control on an inhale.
